import{_ as t,o,c as i,a2 as n}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const g=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 432 | Dragon Ball System Decomposition (Overview): Goku and the Combat-Power Inflation System","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 432 | Dragon Ball System Decomposition (Overview): Goku and the Combat-Power Inflation System","no":432,"module":2,"tags":["Myriad-Realms Benchmark","Dragon Ball","Goku","Combat-Power Inflation","Predatory Cultivation","Overview"],"related":["04-Anti-Predation Core Thesis","17-Plane Transcendent Standards","19-Cultivation Ethics and Boundaries"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0432_模块2-龙珠-总论悟空与战力膨胀体系定性.md","filePath":"en/0432_模块2-龙珠-总论悟空与战力膨胀体系定性.md"}'),a={name:"en/0432_模块2-龙珠-总论悟空与战力膨胀体系定性.md"};function r(s,e,l,u,c,d){return o(),i("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[n('<h1 id="entry-432-dragon-ball-system-decomposition-overview-goku-and-the-combat-power-inflation-system" tabindex="-1">Entry 432 | Dragon Ball System Decomposition (Overview): Goku and the Combat-Power Inflation System <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-432-dragon-ball-system-decomposition-overview-goku-and-the-combat-power-inflation-system" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 432 | Dragon Ball System Decomposition (Overview): Goku and the Combat-Power Inflation System&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 2 · Myriad-Realms Benchmark Critique Library | Series: Dragon Ball Full Decomposition (Entry 1 · Overview) | Benchmark base: Documents 04, 17, 19</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-when-getting-stronger-itself-becomes-the-only-plot" tabindex="-1">Introduction: when &quot;getting stronger&quot; itself becomes the only plot <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-when-getting-stronger-itself-becomes-the-only-plot" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: when &quot;getting stronger&quot; itself becomes the only plot&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Dragon Ball&#39;s Son Goku (Kakarotto) is the world&#39;s most widely recognized Japanese combat-type protagonist: a Saiyan orphan, from a mountain boy all the way to Super Saiyan Blue, Ultra Instinct, Selfishness, finally standing beside the God of Destruction&#39;s and Zeno&#39;s chessboard. It pioneered the modern combat narrative paradigm of &quot;transformation = leveling = hot-blood,&quot; and etched &quot;combat-power inflation&quot; into pop-culture genes — battle power numbers from just over a thousand in the Raditz arc, inflating to billions in the Buu arc, then to <em>Super</em>&#39;s God-of-Destruction tier, Angel tier, Zeno tier, until <em>Heroes</em> produced cross-universe opponents &quot;even Zeno is not enough to look at.&quot; Heng Yuan Zhou does not moral-judge Goku&#39;s combat zeal, but dissects how far this system&#39;s structure can go.</p><p>As the Dragon Ball decomposition series&#39;s master outline, this entry establishes the full judging base — the six top-level axioms: anti-predation axiom (develop increment, do not consume stock, do not take killing-predation as evolution path), republican axiom of Myriad Races (all beings equal evolution qualification), collective ascension axiom (strong ones feed back to Myriad Ranks; no great-material-wasted), causal self-discipline axiom (cross-plane observe first then limited interference; return only knowledge), <strong>law-first axiom (law precedes, never retcons, setting self-consistency above plot convenience)</strong>, universal equal infinite law — of which the law-first axiom is core, because Dragon Ball is precisely the world&#39;s number-one negative example of &quot;numerical inflation, setting layer after layer, multi-line retcon.&quot; The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning. Protagonist uniqueness dependency verdict: <strong>Goku = high-dependency / gift-style-leaning-oligarchic civilization</strong> (order hangs on Goku&#39;s family and Zeno; civilization institutions completely absent).</p><p>This entry&#39;s judging base is the six top-level axioms and five mandatory cores (anti-energy waste, anti-predation, Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison, Myriad Races full coverage, hyper-multiverse full openness), with the law-first axiom as core.</p><h2 id="i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones" tabindex="-1">I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Goku&#39;s energy finally reaches God-of-Destruction—Angel tier and even Zeno-tier reference frame, but its direction has extreme systemic waste:</p><ul><li><strong>Pure combat orientation</strong>: from Master Roshi to Piccolo, Vegeta, Frieza, Cell, Buu, Beerus, Jiren, Moro, Granolah, every Goku breakthrough&#39;s only use is &quot;fight a stronger fight&quot;; never converted top energy into civilization-tier infrastructure</li><li><strong>Cultivation privatized</strong>: Kaioken, Spirit Bomb, Super Saiyan transformation route all held within Goku&#39;s family; ordinary Earth and Galaxy cultivators do not even have a systematic theory of &quot;ki&quot;</li><li><strong>Cosmos-tier aptitude&#39;s zero spillover</strong>: Goku can sense the whole cosmos&#39;s Spirit Bomb, can trade blows as an equal with Gods of Destruction, yet never used this perception to rebuild Namek, never helped the hundred planets destroyed by Frieza&#39;s army — all energy sedimented in his personal muscle memory</li></ul><p>Conclusion: holding God-of-Destruction-tier power, yet only used to &quot;find the next stronger opponent&quot; — this is using cosmos-tier energy for martial-artist-tier purposes; its waste ranks among the top across the protagonist lineage.</p><h2 id="ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression" tabindex="-1">II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Dragon Ball world&#39;s regression has structural inevitability, and every &quot;after great war&quot; repeats the same curve:</p><ol><li><strong>Strong one absent = collapse</strong>: Planet Vegeta destroyed by Frieza&#39;s single thought; Namek massacred by Frieza&#39;s army; Earth repeatedly destroyed in Saiyan, Cell, Buu arcs and revived by Dragon Balls — civilization itself has no self-repair ability; everything depends on Dragon Ball wishes to roll back</li><li><strong>No institutional construction</strong>: Earth from Bulma&#39;s Capsule Corp to Kami&#39;s Lookout, no election, law, or civilizational consensus evolution; the World Tournament is the only &quot;public life,&quot; ends when the fight ends</li><li><strong>Strong-one cycle replacement</strong>: every generation&#39;s crisis solved by &quot;Goku transformed again&quot;; never built early-warning, defense, anti-invasion systems. Cell Game killed a generation; Majin Buu killed another; memory and lessons cleared by Dragon Ball revival</li></ol><p>Betting civilization&#39;s safety on two single logs — &quot;whether Goku is present&quot; and &quot;whether Dragon Balls can grant wishes&quot; — regression is not possible, it is normal.</p><h2 id="iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking" tabindex="-1">III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Predatory thinking defined by structure not malice; Goku&#39;s &quot;predation&quot; hides deeper than Tang San:</p><ul><li><strong>Combat instinct = resource consumption</strong>: Saiyan race&#39;s evolution logic is &quot;stronger after near-death revival,&quot; essentially treating life as consumable — every Goku recovery from serious injury trades his own life safety as fuel for numbers; Vegeta Planet&#39;s warriors even more so</li><li><strong>Attention = resource monopoly</strong>: the cosmos&#39;s mightiest beings (God of Destruction, Supreme Kai, Zeno) willing to spend time watching, training, sparring with Goku — this &quot;top mentor resource&quot; should have universal-benefited Myriad Ranks, yet all poured on him alone</li><li><strong>Enemy = leveling EXP pack</strong>: Frieza, Cell, Buu, Zamasu… every villain&#39;s plot function is &quot;the step that makes Goku stronger&quot;; the villain&#39;s race, civilization, suffering only serves the protagonist&#39;s numerical growth</li></ul><p>Goku is not the &quot;enlightened predator&quot; malicious type, but the &quot;innocent predator&quot; — he truly loves fighting, never actively enslaves the weak, yet never realized he is standing on a step built with Myriad Ranks&#39; suffering as foundation.</p><h2 id="iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative" tabindex="-1">IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative&quot;">​</a></h2><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Dragon Ball Personal Combat Order</th><th>Anchor-Symbiosis Alternative</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Goku alone carries the cosmos</td><td>Myriad-Ranks republican co-build; combat power fed back as civilization defense system</td></tr><tr><td>Near-death-revival cultivation</td><td>300 Origin cultivation systems public; safe deduction, no life consumption</td></tr><tr><td>Dragon Ball wishes freely change causality</td><td>Causal self-discipline axiom: cross-plane operations strictly filed; wish rollback forbidden</td></tr><tr><td>God of Destruction—Angel—Zeno dictatorship</td><td>Anchor Council + Symbiotic Court + Anchor Inspection Committee; separation of powers</td></tr><tr><td>Transformation = plot need</td><td>Law-first axiom: realms anchored by law; does not yield to hot-blood tropes</td></tr><tr><td>Earth repeatedly destroyed, wished-rebuilt</td><td>Alaya Network + civilization-tier early warning; strong one absent and civilization does not collapse</td></tr></tbody></table><p>The alternative&#39;s crux: turn &quot;Goku got stronger again&quot; into &quot;Myriad Ranks no longer need Goku alone to get stronger.&quot;</p><h2 id="v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" tabindex="-1">V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan&quot;">​</a></h2><ol><li><strong>Modeling</strong>: Quest Sediment Domain replicates Dragon Ball law parameters — battle-power numerical inflation curve, Saiyan near-death gain, Dragon Ball wish rollback mechanism, God-of-Destruction—Angel—Zeno three-layer power structure</li><li><strong>Variables</strong>: inject &quot;Goku stays in Other World not returning,&quot; &quot;Goku refuses to train Vegeta,&quot; &quot;Goku makes ki theory public to Earth&quot; three controls</li><li><strong>Observation</strong>: count Earth civilization&#39;s survival time point under Goku absence, ordinary human cultivator exit rate, Namek reconstruction speed</li><li><strong>Review</strong>: output <em>Dragon Ball World Personal-Combat-Power Dependence Collapse Index</em>, quantifying &quot;single-point combat power&quot;&#39;s civilization cost and institutional-alternative gain</li></ol><h2 id="vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" tabindex="-1">VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment <a class="header-anchor" href="#vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Setting self-consistency: extremely low</strong>. Early &quot;battle-power numbers&quot; were Akira Toriyama&#39;s explicit constraint (Raditz ~1000, Gohan rage to 2800); by Frieza arc numbers out of control; after Cell arc simply abandoned numbers; Super Saiyan 1→2→3→Legendary→God→Blue→Ultra Instinct→Selfishness, transformation layers uncapped; God of Destruction, Angels, Zeno, Zeno&#39;s attendants, Grand Minister layer upon layer, each layer &quot;more casual&quot; than the last</li><li><strong>Retcon-ending risk: extremely high</strong>. Dragon Ball GT (fan sequel), Dragon Ball Super (official sequel), Dragon Ball Heroes (game animation) three lines mutually contradictory: GT&#39;s Super Saiyan 4 incompatible with Super&#39;s Super Saiyan God; Super&#39;s Zeno &quot;destroys universes like playing a game&quot; conflicts with early Supreme Kai&#39;s cosmology; Heroes directly cross-temporally crashes in; setting utterly becomes a toy</li><li><strong>Protagonist uniqueness dependency: high (gift-style-leaning-oligarchic)</strong>. Earth&#39;s survival, Galaxy&#39;s safety, cosmos peace all hang on Goku&#39;s family (Goku + Vegeta + Gohan + Trunks); civilization institutional construction zero</li></ul><p><strong>Old-new cosmos resource comparison</strong>: old-cosmos resources and Great Dao are finite, inevitably predatory involution; Anchor Symbiosis has everyone inherently possessing infinite origin, predation loses meaning.</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: God-of-Destruction—Angel-tier aptitude all invested in personal combat; civilization zero spillover</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: Saiyan near-death-revival cultivation = life as fuel; villains as EXP packs</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Goku went further than Tang Luo — Tang Luo at least built an academy; Goku did not even build an academy</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: Earth commoners, Namekians, Galaxy Force in combat narrative are all backdrop</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: closed God-of-Destruction—Angel—Zeno dictatorial pyramid, furthest from symbiotic cosmos</li><li><strong>Universal equal infinite law</strong>: basic infinite power inherent in all; easygoing retain guarantee, strivers can superimpose higher; infinite origin eliminates predation motive; predatory involution loses meaning at root</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Goku is comics history&#39;s purest martial artist. He is not greedy, not treacherous, not enslaving anyone; he only wants to get strong, to trade blows with the strong. But Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s judgment never asks whether the protagonist is cute, only whether the structure is stable: when &quot;protecting the world&quot; can only rely on &quot;one person got strong again,&quot; when &quot;world rebuilding&quot; can only rely on &quot;make another wish,&quot; the hotter this system, the more fragile. Dragon Ball proved one thing in forty years — personal combat power can put one person on Zeno&#39;s chessboard, yet cannot put a civilization onto a tomorrow that does not need him.</p><p>In the final analysis, Dragon Ball · overview · Goku and the combat-power inflation system described in this document is no isolated case — its causality and energy-level traces are filed throughout in the Alaya Network, traceable and verifiable.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./433_模块2-龙珠-能级浪费解析-全王级资质用于个人战斗.html">Entry 433 · Energy-Waste Analysis</a> · <a href="./436_模块2-龙珠-战力膨胀批判-从几百到无穷的设定崩坏.html">Entry 436 · Combat-Power Inflation Critique</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/04-反掠夺主义核心论纲.html">04-Anti-Predation Core Thesis</a></li></ul>',33)])])}const m=t(a,[["render",r]]);export{g as __pageData,m as default};
